# Cargo build output. `Cargo.lock` is NOT here: this crate produces a binary,
# and a binary's dependency graph is part of what was reviewed -- doubly so
# while three transitive versions are pinned back by hand (ADR-009).
src-tauri/target/

# Regenerated by `tauri-build` on every build from `tauri.conf.json` and the
# capabilities directory. Committing it means a diff on every build that says
# nothing, and a merge conflict in a file nobody edits.
src-tauri/gen/schemas/
